            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 79677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos aprender como adicionar e remover valores em uma lista. Como neste aplicativo, que usa uma lista para gerenciar os dados de pontuação do usuário.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Leaderboard&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard {&#xA;            width: 300px;&#xA;            border: 1px solid #ccc;&#xA;            border-radius: 5px;&#xA;            overflow: hidden;&#xA;            margin: 20px auto;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-header {&#xA;            background-color: #2b5188;&#xA;            color: white;&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            font-size: 16px;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-header .trophy {&#xA;            margin-left: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list {&#xA;            list-style: none;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            padding: 0;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li {&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li:nth-child(odd) {&#xA;            background-color: #f9f9f9;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .leaderboard-list li:last-child {&#xA;            border-bottom: none;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .position {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;            color: #555;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .score {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;            color: #333;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;leaderboard&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;leaderboard-header&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;ROUNDS WON&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span class=&quot;trophy&quot;&gt;4 &lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-trophy&quot; style=&quot;color: gold;&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;ul class=&quot;leaderboard-list&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;            &lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;position&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;score&quot;&gt;24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para adicionar o valor <code>25</code> a uma lista, escrevemos o nome da lista seguido por um ponto <code>.</code>, em seguida, a instrução <code>append(25)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>append</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>25</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para adicionar um valor ao final de uma lista, escrevemos o nome da lista, um ponto <code>.</code> e o método <code>append</code> com o valor entre parênteses.</p><p>Adicione o número <code>25</code> ao final de <code>scores</code> para que seja exibido <code>[24, 23, 25]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;25&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>append</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>25</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicionar um valor com <code>.append()</code> o coloca no final da lista. Podemos ver o resultado aqui codificando <code>print(users)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>users</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicionar um valor com <code>.append()</code> o coloca no final da lista.</p><p>Exiba a lista inteira para que o console mostre <code>['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>users</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "insert()",
            "id": 79674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nós adicionamos um valor a um índice específico com <code>insert()</code>. Ao codificar <code>insert(0, \"lemon\")</code>, nós adicionaremos o valor ao início da lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>insert</code> seguido de <code>(0, \"lemon\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicionamos um valor a um índice específico com <code>insert()</code>. Seu primeiro argumento é o índice, e o segundo é o valor.</p><p>Adicione <code>\"lemon\"</code> ao início de <code>shopping</code> para que seja exibido <code>['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>insert</code> seguido de <code>0</code> e finalmente <code>\"lemon\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Insert()",
            "id": 80441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A função <code>insert()</code> tem dois parâmetros. Primeiro, o índice onde queremos inserir o valor, seguido pelo valor.</p><p><code>insert(1, \"chocolate\")</code> adiciona um valor na segunda posição.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>insert</code> seguido de <code>1</code> e depois <code>,</code>, <code>\"chocolate\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A função <code>insert()</code> tem dois parâmetros: o índice em que o valor fica e, em seguida, o próprio valor, separados por uma vírgula.</p><p>Insira <code>\"chocolate\"</code> como o segundo elemento para que seja exibido <code>['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>insert</code> seguido de <code>1</code>, <code>,</code> e finalmente <code>\"chocolate\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One at a time",
            "id": 79673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para ambos <code>append()</code> e <code>insert()</code>, podemos adicionar apenas um elemento por vez.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>append</code> seguido de <code>insert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para ambos <code>append()</code> e <code>insert()</code>, podemos adicionar apenas um elemento por vez.</p><p>Adicione <code>\"LC\"</code> ao final e <code>\"LS\"</code> no índice <code>1</code>, para que seja exibido <code>['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>append</code> seguido de <code>insert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "pop()",
            "id": 79672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para remover o último elemento de uma lista, escrevemos o nome da lista <code>todo</code>, um ponto <code>.</code> e a instrução <code>pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Store saved element",
            "id": 80443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para remover um valor em um índice específico, adicionamos o índice que queremos remover entre parênteses, como <code>pop(1)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom', 'painting']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pop</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>1</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use <code>pop()</code> para remover um elemento da lista, com o índice dele entre parênteses.</p><p>Remova <code>\"dishes\"</code> para a lista imprimir <code>['call mom', 'painting']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom', 'painting']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pop</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>1</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Stored",
            "id": 80489,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O valor removido pode ser armazenado dentro de uma variável também. Podemos ver isso aqui quando codificamos <code>print(removed)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removed = todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(removed)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"78\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"call mom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print(removed)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Append",
            "id": 79671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual instrução usamos para adicionar um valor a uma lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.append()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>.append()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usamos <code>.append()</code> para adicionar um valor a uma lista.</p><p>Qual código adiciona <code>\"tea\"</code> a <code>drinks</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>drinks.append(\"tea\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>drinks.pop(\"tea\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>append.drinks(\"tea\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>drinks.append(\"tea\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the list",
            "id": 79670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para onde vai um novo valor que adicionamos com <code>.append()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No final da lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No início da lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No final da lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um valor adicionado com <code>.append()</code> vai para o final de uma lista.</p><p>Após <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code> e <code>colors.append(\"green\")</code>, o que <code>colors</code> contém?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"red\", \"blue\", \"green\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"green\", \"red\", \"blue\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"red\", \"green\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[\"red\", \"blue\", \"green\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 79669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quantos valores de cada vez podemos adicionar a uma lista usando <code>.append()</code> e <code>.insert()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um valor de cada vez</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quantos quisermos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um valor de cada vez.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada chamada de <code>.append()</code> ou <code>.insert()</code> adiciona um valor por vez.</p><p>Você quer que <code>\"tea\"</code> e <code>\"water\"</code> se tornem dois elementos separados. O que deve fazer?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Chamar <code>.append()</code> uma vez para cada valor.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Passar os dois valores como argumentos separados em uma chamada de <code>.append()</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Adicionar uma lista com os dois valores para criar dois elementos separados.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Chamar <code>.append()</code> uma vez para cada valor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 79668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual instrução usamos para remover o último elemento de uma lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.insert()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chamar <code>.pop()</code> sem um índice remove o último elemento de uma lista.</p><p>Para <code>plans = [\"work\", \"eat\", \"sleep\"]</code>, qual código remove <code>\"sleep\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>plans.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.insert()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.pop(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>plans.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 79667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos salvar o valor removido por <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Armazenando em uma variável</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não podemos salvá-lo, <code>.pop()</code> não nos devolve um valor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Armazenando em uma variável.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sem um índice, <code>.pop()</code> remove e retorna o último elemento, permitindo armazená-lo em uma variável.</p><p>Para <code>queue = [\"Ada\", \"Ben\"]</code>, qual código remove <code>\"Ben\"</code> e o armazena em <code>removed_user</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>removed_user = queue.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>queue.pop() = removed_user</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>removed_user = queue</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>removed_user = queue.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
